# Miscellaneous
# -----------------------------------------------

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp

# Makefile empty target files, containing a timestamp
*.stamp

# -----------------------------------------------
# Datasets
# -----------------------------------------------

# Raw datasets
#   Counter-Strike demos (.dem) can exceed GitHub's 100 MiB file limit. Ignore
#   raw datasets by default. Smaller files may be committed later if useful for
#   reproducibility; update these rules accordingly.
*.dem
/data/raw/*
!/data/raw/.gitkeep

# Processed datasets
#   Small generated datasets may be committed for reproducibility.
#   Reconsider this policy if datasets become substantially larger.
#/data/processed/*
#!/data/processed/.gitkeep
